      "number": 32,
      "question": "Equivalent resistance of R1 and R2 in parallel?",
      "options": {
        "A": "R1 + R2",
        "B": "(R1 × R2) / (R1 + R2)",
        "C": "R1 / R2",
        "D": "R1 - R2"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "(R1 × R2) / (R1 + R2).",
      "hash": "aec75f7e63a56873",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि दो प्रतिरोध R1 और R2 समानांतर (Parallel) जुड़े हों, तो समतुल्य प्रतिरोध क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "R1 + R2",
            "B": "(R1 × R2) / (R1 + R2)",
            "C": "R1 / R2",
            "D": "R1 - R2"
          },
          "explanation": "1/R = 1/R1 + 1/R2 => R = (R1R2)/(R1+R2)।"
        }
      }
    },
